    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My sister is so weird. Sometimes I wonder if we're actually related.$u",
      "translation": "Moje sestra je tak divná. Někdy přemýšlím, jestli jsme vůbec příbuzné.$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "85cdf13b89d72100ee39af1718c975513d0e4aa905acf40a60953e3d783c3928",
      "translationSHA256": "b8807bfb25c440cf1fe11bed766120a2297837390c112a7d28d2b4783c2014ab",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Wed8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "There are only two things I like about this town.#$b#One of them is the beach.#$e#The other one is a secret! *giggle*$h",
      "translation": "Na tomhle městě se mi líbí jen dvě věci.#$b#Jednou z nich je pláž.#$e#Ta druhá je tajná! *hihňání*$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "d66e4e41f639b800403a0c2f23f1171551aa3edd57025511f4f91b0a879fb065",
      "translationSHA256": "f11d97f2048d24c33e1333098eed6567b7c6180d9099bf5bfdfec42bb1f35923",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Tue2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wonder if any nice shells washed up on the beach this morning?#$e#This isn't the best time of year for shells, though.",
      "translation": "Zajímalo by mě, jestli dnes ráno moře nevyplavilo na pláž nějaké pěkné mušle.#$e#Na mušle ale teď není nejlepší roční období.",
      "sourceSHA256": "f8dce745590e38e4bffc479664c586c6738ee1d629fa6c36fe743d7b71b7f46c",
      "translationSHA256": "4c6421b42d92851b8e6eecc77e445d3d93757db4f29c0aeaa53c52d812695c43",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Wed4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm glad that the flowers are starting to bloom.#$e#Those pink ones smell so good.$h",
      "translation": "Jsem ráda, že začínají kvést květiny.#$e#Ty růžové tak krásně voní.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "4d1b1514aa8b53b3009987521c86dd97fabb1fa66518c6647913a7c20c8275b7",
      "translationSHA256": "a32988c0f42a9e2fe4b25e06e23898cef3271115b611d851f57b663f1547d230",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Fri6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I need to find some kind of hobby other than shopping.#$e#I've decided I want to expand my horizons.#$e#Maybe I should learn to play the mini-harp?",
      "translation": "Musím si najít nějakého koníčka kromě nakupování.#$e#Rozhodla jsem se, že si chci rozšířit obzory.#$e#Možná bych se měla naučit hrát na malou harfu?",
      "sourceSHA256": "06a31f7c60bb1c40decd0a0a3b7997017c34971a08e2fce30d2065d9f4ce9913",
      "translationSHA256": "8a70349d7996745e632f7f7f0d0663c30c86a6397c0f8ac4c1dd5830ea9d67c6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Mon6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I used to complain about this town being so small, but I've grown to like it.#$e#If it was much bigger it wouldn't feel like a community.",
      "translation": "Dřív jsem si stěžovala, že je tohle město tak malé, ale postupně jsem si ho oblíbila.#$e#Kdyby bylo mnohem větší, nepůsobilo by jako komunita.",
      "sourceSHA256": "f2d1310f9bee60276f5fcafef490778c73a8c118d1a85d49697b546be529a52e",
      "translationSHA256": "a0f8a424ef0d65ba1eed9db64e63efaed70ac9e17df6d41d14eca0e4a6622cec",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Thu6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I cooked dinner last night. It actually turned out okay!#$e#But I did make a huge mess in the kitchen...",
      "translation": "Včera večer jsem uvařila večeři. Vlastně dopadla docela dobře!#$e#V kuchyni jsem ale udělala obrovský nepořádek...",
      "sourceSHA256": "1b036340c9474cfc0ad509d4f23c087c574ac4b9cd111b76f58c20f1fa9af28d",
      "translationSHA256": "974b4787ab029f42da7b3836a6d8e632fd57337e9c14ecd7880c5c5729285cbf",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm thinking about donating a bunch of clothes... I must have a hundred pairs of shoes.",
      "translation": "Přemýšlím, že daruji spoustu oblečení... Musím mít snad sto párů bot.",
      "sourceSHA256": "09a5fa55646d13cb6afdc5d008481f744d614565a399d2b3bffc511f6ceaa028",
      "translationSHA256": "482780333ab40abf066a3ef18a750188d354ab83917be7928b2f877e601469cc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
